Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.17,0:14:22.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,快放了小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.39,0:14:25.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,快回答我 公主她在哪裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.47,0:14:29.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,送去暗塌谷帝國了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:34.72,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴？真白？阿翼？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.07,0:14:37.29,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,蝴蝶... 在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.48,0:14:39.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵呵...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:41.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵呵呵...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.66,0:14:42.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:48.52,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.33,0:14:53.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空被...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:55.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,傳送到暗塌谷帝國...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.80,0:14:57.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,他一定是在說謊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.80,0:14:59.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,說謊？我是不會說謊的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.15,0:15:02.82,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我所追求的唯有真實
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:08.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做 一人之下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:08.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}結合劇情 スキ在此理解為副手之意(宰相 大祭司) ahead為領先者 先驅
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.83,0:15:12.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,遵照帝國的支配者 女帝·暗塌谷陛下之命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.17,0:15:15.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,接收天空公主
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.71,0:15:17.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝·暗塌谷...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.24,0:15:22.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我只被命令帶回公主
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.72,0:15:24.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就此告辭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.18,0:15:27.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,感謝女帝陛下沒改變想法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:30.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們說不定是撿回了一條命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.97,0:15:33.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.35,0:15:38.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,無謂的掙扎...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.05,0:15:40.63,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.81,0:15:47.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.00,0:15:57.23,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:00.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,打開
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.94,0:16:18.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,還給我們
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:22.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,把我們的小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.01,0:16:25.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,還回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.60,0:16:28.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:32.40,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:34.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,防護
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.53,0:16:38.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:47.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,炸裂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.89,0:16:50.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:51.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:07.55,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有了啊 你們已經沒有救公主的手段了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.02,0:17:10.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這一切的一切都已經結束
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.55,0:17:15.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 空...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.97,0:17:29.42,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,最喜歡了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:54.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對要...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.37,0:17:57.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,救回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:24.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.55,0:18:26.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.93,0:18:28.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:31.74,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.88,0:18:39.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛 虛蜢達 彌諾彤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.79,0:18:45.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,打亂了他們行動的Precure 在一人之下面前毫無還手之力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.64,0:18:50.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵呵呵呵... 啊哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:01.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.21,0:19:15.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.15,0:19:26.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是... 誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.10,0:19:29.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,消失吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.10,0:19:33.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.34,0:19:36.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.70,0:19:52.52,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,難道是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.36,0:19:55.04,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,新的Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.47,0:19:58.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,防護
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.32,0:20:10.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,試問 汝之名？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.24,0:20:13.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.24,0:20:13.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}威愛愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.01,0:20:16.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure... Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.54,0:20:24.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.73,0:20:29.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你的名字 我記錄到知識宮殿之中吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.73,0:20:29.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}一種知識分類法 也有叫做記憶宮殿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:51.73,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,結束了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.29,0:20:54.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Majesty呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.79,0:20:55.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.32,0:20:57.30,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.46,0:20:58.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.24,0:21:01.28,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:03.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:10.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.73,0:21:11.36,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.52,0:21:13.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒事就好 公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:16.18,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了... 真的太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.69,0:21:21.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空... 嚇到你了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.97,0:21:23.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起... 對不起...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:27.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有保護好你 對不起...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.57,0:21:30.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.67,0:21:39.94,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,不要哭 真白
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:45.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕對不會再放手了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.46,0:21:47.90,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.35,0:21:52.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,新的敵人 一人之下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.04,0:21:56.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,還有帝國的支配者 女帝·暗塌谷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.18,0:21:58.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,為了保護小空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.90,0:22:02.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們必須要變得更強...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.69,0:22:10.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Grace！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.69,0:22:10.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1060,975)}優雅愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.81,0:22:13.71,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起 手牽手 心頭一緊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.44,0:23:50.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Majesty究竟是什麼來頭？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.26,0:23:51.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,非常厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.99,0:23:54.44,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎麼樣 都要保護好小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.68,0:23:55.91,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.20,0:23:58.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 你怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.02,0:24:01.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.02,0:24:01.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.57,0:24:04.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大變身！Cure Majesty!!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.57,0:24:04.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1085,970)}威愛愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:40.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.49,0:01:46.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.29,0:01:51.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.63,0:01:59.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.59,0:02:04.50,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.77,0:02:08.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.75,0:02:10.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.23,0:02:14.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.11,0:02:19.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.20,0:02:21.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.20,0:02:25.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:29.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.62,0:02:33.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.65,0:02:33.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:35.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:40.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:45.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.68,0:02:50.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.89,0:02:55.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.86,0:02:58.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:03:06.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
